[41.83662, "o", "The query should return: \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> SELECT ?professorName (GROUP_CONCAT(DISTINCT ?country; separator=\", \") AS ?countries)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ``` \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[41.83695, "o", "where ?professorName is the professor'\"'\"'s name, and ?countries lists all countries where the professor currently works in.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> Save your query in `/app/solution.sparql`.' -y --exit-immediately; tmux wait -S done\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
