[47.118282, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI’ll inspect the Turtle ontology and instance data to understand the class/property structure, then build and validate the SPARQL query.\r\n\r\n```\r\nls -la /app && wc -l /app/university_graph.ttl && sed -n '1,240p' /app/university_graph.ttl\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
