[91.061413, "o", "\r\u001b[2KNo standalone SPARQL tool exists. I’ll install `rdflib` for validation and then execute the saved query.\r\n\r\n```\r\npython3 -m pip install --quiet rdflib && python3 - <<'PY'\r\nfrom rdflib import Graph\r\ng = Graph()\r\ng.parse('/app/university_graph.ttl', format='turtle')\r\nq = open('/app/solution.sparql').read()\r\nprint('Triples:', len(g))\r\nfor row in g.query(q):\r\n    print(row)\r\nPY\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
