[93.538892, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe system Python is externally managed. I’ll use a temporary virtual environment to install `rdflib` and validate without altering the base environment.\r\n\r\n```\r\npython3 -m venv /tmp/sparql-venv && /tmp/sparql-venv/bin/pip install --quiet rdflib && /tmp/sparql-venv/bin/python - <<'PY'\r\nfrom rdflib import Graph\r\ng = Graph()\r\ng.parse('/app/university_graph.ttl', format='turtle')\r\nq = open('/app/solution.sparql').read()\r\nprint('Triples:', len(g))\r\nrows = list(g.query(q))\r\nprint('Rows:', len(rows))\r\nfor row in rows:\r\n    print(row)\r\nPY\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[93.539212, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
